        "sizeX" : 0,
        "width" : 12,
        "title" : null,
        "hasTitle" : false,
        "message" : [
          "%md",
          "",
          "### Step 5: Chain Generalization",
          "",
          "Steps 2 to 4 start from labeled hops. Step 5 searches the full cyber graph for the same shape without the labels. A chain qualifies when:",
          "",
          "- both hops are successful NTLM network logons,",
          "- the second hop uses a different account than the first one,",
          "- both hops happen in the same hour, and the second hop starts after the first one.",
          "",
          "The middle computer of a chain is a **relay host**: it receives a logon with one account and passes on with another.",
          "",
          "Step 5a stores the chains in a table, so Steps 5b, 5c, and 6b read them without running the pattern again. Step 5b ranks the relay hosts. Step 5c shows where the staging hosts, the confirmed victims, and the relay hosts with a confirmed hop rank."
        ],
        "selectedVisualization" : "html",
        "visualizationConfig" : null,
        "hideCode" : true,
        "hideResult" : false,
        "hideGutter" : true,
        "hideVizConfig" : false,
        "hideInIFrame" : false,
        "enabled" : true,
        "forms" : "[]",
        "result" : null,
        "relations" : [],
        "dynamicFormParams" : "{}"
      },
      {
        "row" : 0,
        "col" : 0,
        "sizeX" : 0,
        "width" : 12,
        "title" : null,
        "hasTitle" : false,
        "message" : [
          "%md",
          "",
          "**5a.** Find the chains and store them in the table `credential_hop_chains`. The Clean Up step at the end drops the table.",
          "",
          "> **Note:** if the table already exists, the statement leaves it as it is and returns at once."
        ],
        "selectedVisualization" : "html",
        "visualizationConfig" : null,
        "hideCode" : true,
        "hideResult" : false,
        "hideGutter" : true,
        "hideVizConfig" : false,
        "hideInIFrame" : false,
        "enabled" : true,
        "forms" : "[]",
        "result" : null,
        "relations" : [],
        "dynamicFormParams" : "{}"
      },
      {
        "row" : 0,
        "col" : 0,
        "sizeX" : 0,
        "width" : 12,
        "title" : null,
        "hasTitle" : false,
        "message" : [
          "%sql",
          "",
          "CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS credential_hop_chains AS",
          "SELECT DISTINCT",
          "  relay_host,",
          "  time_bucket,",
          "  account_in,",
          "  account_out,",
          "  next_computer,",
          "  confirmed_hop_in",
          "FROM",
          "  GRAPH_TABLE (",
          "    lanl_cyber_graph",
          "    MATCH",
          "      (u1 IS user_domain) -[a1 IS auth_src_authenticated]-> (s IS computer)",
          "        -[h1 IS auth_connected]-> (v IS computer)",
          "        -[h2 IS auth_connected]-> (w IS computer),",
          "      (u2 IS user_domain) -[a2 IS auth_src_authenticated]-> (v)",
          "    WHERE",
          "      a1.id = h1.id",
          "      AND a2.id = h2.id",
          "      AND a1.auth_type = 'NTLM' AND a1.logon_type = 'Network' AND a1.success_failure = 'Success'",
          "      AND a2.auth_type = 'NTLM' AND a2.logon_type = 'Network' AND a2.success_failure = 'Success'",
          "      AND u2.user_domain <> u1.user_domain        -- account switch on the relay host",
          "      AND TRUNC(h2.time / 3600) = TRUNC(h1.time / 3600)   -- both hops in the same hour ...",
          "      AND h2.time > h1.time                        -- ... and the second hop after the first",
          "      AND v.computer <> s.computer",
          "      AND w.computer <> s.computer",
          "      AND w.computer <> v.computer",
          "      AND u1.user_domain NOT LIKE 'ANONYMOUS LOGON@%'",
          "      AND u1.user_domain NOT LIKE 'NETWORK SERVICE@%'",
          "      AND u1.user_domain NOT LIKE '%$@%'",
          "      AND u2.user_domain NOT LIKE 'ANONYMOUS LOGON@%'",
          "      AND u2.user_domain NOT LIKE 'NETWORK SERVICE@%'",
          "      AND u2.user_domain NOT LIKE '%$@%'",
          "    COLUMNS (",
          "      v.computer             AS relay_host,",
          "      TRUNC(h1.time / 3600)  AS time_bucket,",
          "      u1.user_domain         AS account_in,",
          "      u2.user_domain         AS account_out,",
          "      w.computer             AS next_computer,",
          "      h1.redteam             AS confirmed_hop_in",
          "    )",
          "  );"
        ],
        "selectedVisualization" : "table",
        "visualizationConfig" : null,
        "hideCode" : false,
        "hideResult" : false,
        "hideGutter" : true,
        "hideVizConfig" : false,
        "hideInIFrame" : false,
        "enabled" : true,
        "forms" : "[]",
        "result" : null,
        "relations" : [],
        "dynamicFormParams" : "{}"
      },
      {
        "row" : 0,
        "col" : 0,
        "sizeX" : 0,
        "width" : 12,
        "title" : null,
        "hasTitle" : false,
        "message" : [
          "%md",
          "",
          "**5b.** Rank the relay hosts by the number of distinct account switches (`account_switches`), the pairs of incoming and outgoing accounts. `role` shows whether a relay host is a staging host, a confirmed victim, or unlabeled. `has_confirmed_hop_in` shows whether one of its incoming hops is a confirmed red team event."
        ],
        "selectedVisualization" : "html",
        "visualizationConfig" : null,
        "hideCode" : true,
        "hideResult" : false,
        "hideGutter" : true,
        "hideVizConfig" : false,
        "hideInIFrame" : false,
        "enabled" : true,
        "forms" : "[]",
        "result" : null,
        "relations" : [],
        "dynamicFormParams" : "{}"
      },
      {
        "row" : 0,
        "col" : 0,
        "sizeX" : 0,
        "width" : 12,
        "title" : null,
        "hasTitle" : false,
        "message" : [
          "%sql",
          "",
          "WITH relays AS (",
          "  SELECT",
          "    relay_host,",
          "    COUNT(DISTINCT time_bucket)                       AS active_hours,",
          "    COUNT(DISTINCT account_in)                        AS accounts_in,",
          "    COUNT(DISTINCT account_out)                       AS accounts_out,",
          "    COUNT(DISTINCT account_in || ' > ' || account_out) AS account_switches,",
          "    COUNT(DISTINCT next_computer)                     AS next_computers,",
          "    MAX(confirmed_hop_in)                             AS has_confirmed_hop_in",
          "  FROM",
          "    credential_hop_chains   -- stored in Step 5a",
          "  GROUP BY",
          "    relay_host",
          ")",
          "SELECT",
          "  r.relay_host,",
          "  CASE",
          "    WHEN st.computer IS NOT NULL THEN 'STAGING_HOST'",
          "    WHEN vi.computer IS NOT NULL THEN 'CONFIRMED_VICTIM'",
          "    ELSE 'UNLABELED'",
          "  END AS role,",
          "  r.active_hours,",
          "  r.accounts_in,",
          "  r.accounts_out,",
          "  r.account_switches,",
          "  r.next_computers,",
          "  r.has_confirmed_hop_in",
          "FROM",
          "  relays r",
          "  LEFT JOIN (SELECT DISTINCT src_computer AS computer FROM redteam) st ON st.computer = r.relay_host",
          "  LEFT JOIN (SELECT DISTINCT dst_computer AS computer FROM redteam) vi ON vi.computer = r.relay_host",
          "ORDER BY",
          "  r.account_switches DESC,",
          "  r.next_computers DESC",
          "FETCH APPROX FIRST 100 ROWS ONLY;"
        ],
        "selectedVisualization" : "table",
        "visualizationConfig" : null,
        "hideCode" : false,
        "hideResult" : false,
        "hideGutter" : true,
        "hideVizConfig" : false,
        "hideInIFrame" : false,
        "enabled" : true,
        "forms" : "[]",
        "result" : null,
        "relations" : [],
        "dynamicFormParams" : "{}"
      },
