          "",
          "**Result:** 6 of the 10 relay hosts with the most account switches are confirmed victims. The top ones look like servers: `C1065` receives logons from 1,389 accounts and passes on with only 2, and `C586` is the most central computer of the graph (Scenario 2, Step 6b). Among the unlabeled relay hosts, `C4313` shows the clearest chain shape: 21 accounts in, 10 accounts out, and 34 next computers in 29 hours."
        ],
