          "%md",
          "",
          "### Step 6: Structural Ranking",
          "",
          "Where do the chains end? A chain that ends at a central computer, such as a domain controller, is a bigger risk than one that ends at a workstation. Step 6a computes the PageRank scores once and stores them. Step 6b ranks the computers at the end of the chains from Step 5a."
        ],
        "selectedVisualization" : "html",
        "visualizationConfig" : null,
        "hideCode" : true,
