          "",
          "**Result:** the chains end at 90 computers. The 8 with the highest PageRank are `C586`, `C612`, `C529`, `C625`, `C467`, `C457`, `C1065`, and `C528`. The first seven of them also top the PageRank ranking of Scenario 2, Step 6b. 18 chain ends follow a chain with a confirmed incoming hop, among them `C529`, `C457`, `C1065`, and `C528`."
