          "",
          "## Ideas for Further Analysis",
          "",
          "- Add a third hop, `-[h3 IS auth_connected]-> (x IS computer)` with `h3.time > h2.time`, to follow longer chains. Each hop multiplies the run time, so start from the relay hosts of Step 5b.",
          "- Join the chain ends with `flows_connected` edges to check for data transfers after the last hop.",
          "- Use the top relay hosts of Step 5b as seeds for `PERSONALIZED_PAGERANK_SET` to rank the computers closest to the chains.",
